MetaSplice Release 2.0 -- third-party software and data
=========================================================

MetaSplice's own code, model and derived data are under the MetaSplice licence (LICENSE). The components below keep
their own terms. Sources and the wording of each licence are recorded in docs/FEATURE_LICENCES.md of the MetaSplice
repository.

Software included in the Docker image
-------------------------------------
SpliceTransformer -- Apache License 2.0.
  You N, et al. Nat Commun. 2024;15:9129. https://github.com/ShenLab-Genomics/SpliceTransformer, commit b67a51d.
  Weights: SpTransformer_pytorch.ckpt (md5 f9f9c491cae4e854eef644a7a97753de), from the authors' distribution.
  MODIFIED: /opt/SpliceTransformer/MODIFICATIONS.patch (Apache-2.0 section 4(b)) -- a PyTorch 2.6 checkpoint-loading
  fix in tasks_annotate_mutations.py; weights and computations unchanged.

Pangolin 1.0.2 -- GNU General Public License v3.
  Zeng T, Li YI. Genome Biol. 2022;23:103. https://github.com/tkzeng/Pangolin, commit 5cf94b8.
  Pangolin and its weights run as a separate program. Its complete source, including the modification, is in
  /opt/Pangolin; the GPL v3 text is /opt/Pangolin/LICENSE.
  MODIFIED: /opt/Pangolin/MODIFICATIONS.patch (GPL v3 section 5(a)), dated 2026-04-13 -- the reference sequence is
  upper-cased before the REF check, so soft-masked positions are scored instead of skipped.

Python packages: PyTorch 2.6.0 and the packages pinned in requirements.lock, each under its own licence. The licence
  metadata of every installed package is listed in /opt/metasplice/PYTHON_PACKAGE_LICENSES.txt, generated in the image
  at build time from the packages themselves.

Not included: SpliceAI. Its source code is under the PolyForm Strict License 1.0.0, which does not permit
redistribution. It is used only as a comparator in the paper.

Data included in the image
--------------------------
GENCODE v50 MANE Select and MANE Plus Clinical annotation (and databases built from it) -- GENCODE/Ensembl: "no
  restrictions on access to, or use of, the data". Harrow J, et al. Genome Res. 2012;22:1760-74; Morales J, et al.
  Nature. 2022;604:310-5.

Gene-level values (metasplice_gene_level_dbNSFP5.4.tsv.gz): gnomAD_pLI (gnomAD v2.1.1), gnomAD_LOEUF (gnomAD v4.1)
  and ClinGen_Haploinsufficiency_Score (ClinGen gene curation list of 28 July 2026), for HGNC's genes of 28 July 2026.
  gnomAD, ClinGen and HGNC release these data under CC0. data/build_gene_level.py builds the file from them, with the
  rules of the dbNSFP 5.4 gene file, whose values it reproduces (data/README_gene_level.md). Karczewski KJ, et al.
  Nature. 2020;581:434-43; Chen S, et al. Nature. 2024;625:92-100; Liu X, et al. Genome Med. 2020;12:103.

