  Quang. Quang D, et al. Bioinformatics. 2015;31:761-3. The original host (cbcl.ics.uci.edu) is offline; the bundle
  carries the full-precision GRCh37 scores with the MIT notice.
GPN-MSA precomputed scores -- MIT License (songlab/gpn-msa-hg38-scores). Benegas G, et al. Nat Biotechnol.
  2025;43:1960-5.
phyloP and phastCons, 100-way vertebrate and 470-way mammalian (UCSC, GRCh38) -- "freely available for public use";
  UCSC data are free "for both public and commercial use". Pollard KS, et al. Genome Res. 2010;20:110-21;
  Siepel A, et al. Genome Res. 2005;15:1034-50.
gnomAD v4.1 (optional; allele frequency is reported, not a model input) -- Creative Commons Zero. Chen S, et al.
  Nature. 2024;625:92-100.
GRCh38 and GRCh37 reference sequences (UCSC hg38, hg19) -- UCSC Genome Browser data.
Ensembl GRCh37<->GRCh38 chain (per-position tables built from it) -- Ensembl: no restrictions.
GENCODE v50 comprehensive GTF -- as above.
